  "card": {
    "schema": "2.0",
    "config": {
      "update_multi": true,
      "summary": {
        "content": "Welcome to Fathomry."
      },
      "style": {
        "color": {
          "welcome_muted": {
            "light_mode": "rgba(112,112,120,1)",
            "dark_mode": "rgba(184,184,194,1)"
          }
        },
        "text_size": {
          "welcome_hero": {
            "default": "heading-0",
            "pc": "heading-0",
            "mobile": "heading-0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "body": {
      "direction": "vertical",
      "padding": "24px 24px 20px 24px",
      "vertical_spacing": "0px",
      "elements": [
        {
          "tag": "column_set",
          "flex_mode": "stretch",
          "columns": [
            {
              "tag": "column",
              "width": "weighted",
              "weight": 1,
              "elements": [
                {
                  "tag": "markdown",
                  "content": "**Fathomry**",
                  "text_size": "heading-4",
                  "text_align": "left",
                  "margin": "0px"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "column",
              "width": "weighted",
              "weight": 2,
              "elements": [
                {
                  "tag": "markdown",
                  "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>GOOD THINGS START SMALL</font>",
                  "text_size": "x-small",
                  "text_align": "right",
                  "margin": "4px 0px 0px 0px"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "hr",
          "margin": "16px 0px 0px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "<font color='orange'>╱</font>　 <font color='purple'>✦</font>　 <font color='carmine'>•</font>　 <font color='blue'>╲</font>　 <font color='green'>✧</font>",
          "text_size": "heading-2",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "30px 0px 14px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>HERE'S TO WHAT COMES NEXT.</font>",
          "text_size": "x-small",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "0px 0px 14px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "element_id": "intro",
          "content": "**Welcome to<br>Fathomry.**",
          "text_size": "welcome_hero",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>A place for ideas<br>to find their rhythm.</font>",
          "text_size": "heading-3",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "18px 0px 24px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "column_set",
          "flex_mode": "stretch",
          "horizontal_spacing": "12px",
          "margin": "0px 0px 28px 0px",
          "columns": [
            {
              "tag": "column",
              "width": "weighted",
              "weight": 1,
              "elements": [
                {
                  "tag": "button",
                  "text": {
                    "tag": "plain_text",
                    "content": "Explore Fathomry ↗"
                  },
                  "type": "primary",
                  "behaviors": [
                    {
                      "type": "open_url",
                      "default_url": "https://github.com/frost-leo/fathomry"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "horizontal_align": "right"
            },
            {
              "tag": "column",
              "width": "weighted",
              "weight": 1,
              "elements": [
                {
                  "tag": "button",
                  "text": {
                    "tag": "plain_text",
                    "content": "Find your way →"
                  },
                  "type": "default",
                  "behaviors": [
                    {
                      "type": "open_url",
                      "default_url": "https://github.com/frost-leo/fathomry/blob/develop/docs/README.md"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "horizontal_align": "left"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "collapsible_panel",
          "element_id": "welcome_guide",
          "expanded": false,
          "margin": "0px 0px 8px 0px",
          "padding": "12px 0px 0px 0px",
          "vertical_spacing": "12px",
          "header": {
            "title": {
              "tag": "markdown",
              "content": "**A little direction, when you need it.**"
            },
            "padding": "8px 0px 8px 0px"
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "tag": "markdown",
              "content": "Fathomry is a Go framework for durable, observable data workflows on Temporal.",
              "text_size": "normal",
              "text_align": "left",
              "margin": "0px"
            },
            {
              "tag": "markdown",
              "text_size": "normal",
              "content": "**Explore the project** — source code and contribution guidelines.<br>**Read the documentation** — architecture, package contracts and runnable examples.<br>**Try a notification** — native cards, charts, files and explicit delivery evidence."
            },
            {
              "tag": "markdown",
              "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>Explore at your own pace. The documentation connects architecture, package contracts and runnable examples.</font>",
              "text_size": "notation",
              "text_align": "left",
              "margin": "0px"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "element_id": "closing",
          "content": "<font color='orange'>✦</font>",
          "text_size": "heading-3",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "30px 0px 14px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "**Start with a spark.**<br><font color='welcome_muted'>Build something that lasts.</font>",
          "text_size": "heading-1",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>There is room for what you imagine.<br>We're glad you're here.</font>",
          "text_size": "normal",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "20px 0px 28px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hr",
          "margin": "0px 0px 16px 0px"
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "<font color='welcome_muted'>Fathomry · Made for the work ahead.</font>",
          "text_size": "x-small",
          "text_align": "center",
          "margin": "0px"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
